title: "CCR-DAE: Configuration-Conditioned Residual Denoising-Autoencoder Recommender"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of CCR-DAE, a meta-learning recommender that selects
  a classification algorithm and its hyperparameters for a dataset on which no
  configuration has been evaluated.
